  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable sealed Luo Po Valley. Ordinary methods cannot open entry; a rank five Open Door Gu is required.",
        "chapters": [
          517
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable",
          "loc_luo_po_valley"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan has already refined Open Door Gu and close door Gu as the key to enter Thieving Heaven’s Luo Po Valley inheritance.",
        "chapters": [
          731
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-key",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "At Luo Po Valley, by then Shadow Sect’s stronghold full of Gu formations, Open Door Gu and close door Gu draw no response.",
        "chapters": [
          953
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "shadow-sects-valley",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_shadow_sect",
          "sys_gu_formation"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s use of Open Door Gu at Luo Po Valley in his previous life brought nothing, and he took it that Shadow Sect had already broken Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable’s arrangement. In this life, after he uses it inside the valley, an entrance of light appears and a beam carries him into a Thieving Heaven true inheritance space. Activating this rank five mortal Gu again forms a new entrance of light that can return him from that space to Luo Po Valley.",
        "chapters": [
          991
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "entrance-of-light",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "inh_thieving_heaven_true_inheritance",
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
